  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - Alduin uses the same shout as he did at Helgen, raining down fiery meteors from
    the sky.
  - 'Alduin yells out: Kreh Yol Toor Shul. (Aren''t shouts only supposed to be three
    words long?)'
  - Alduin yells out the same shout again, while peppering in some standard fire
    breath.
  - Another volley of meteors rain down from the heavens.
  - Alduin summons a spinning pillar of fire.
  - Alduin creates intersections of two spinning pillars of fire.
  - Yet another volley of meteors rains down.
  - Alduin breathes three powerful streams of fire.
  - Meteors, meteors! Someone, stop them!
  - Alduin summons vortexes of fire.
  - Alduin unleashes yet more vortexes of fire.
  randomAttacks:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0db7db01988fe954cae774365eb51a76, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: cb562242259fc2548a2ac91ca375b505, type: 2}
