  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: bdd469feb01c3b540b24ac9c5d7832e4, type: 2}
  randomFlavorTexts:
  - Alduin slashes his claws at {mc}.
  - Alduin attempts to strike at {mc} with his claws, with {mc} attempting to block
    with his shield.
  - Alduin unleashes a barrage of small fireballs, which {mc} attempts to block.
  - METEORS!!!
  - '{mc} finds his left foot caught on a rock as Alduin breathes fire at him directly.'
  - Alduin bites at {mc}.
  - Alduin rains fire down from above.
  - Alduin unveils a multi-colored display of fire the side.
  - Alduin unveils a multi-colored display of fire from all directions.
  maxHealth: 250
